# SOC169 - Possible IDOR Attack Detected | LetsDefend Walkthrough

## Overview

This repository contains my investigation and analysis of the **SOC169 - Possible IDOR Attack Detected** alert from the LetsDefend SOC platform.

The investigation focused on:
- IDOR attack analysis
- HTTP traffic investigation
- Sequential parameter enumeration
- Response analysis
- Endpoint investigation
- Incident response workflow

The alert was classified as a **True Positive** because unauthorized access attempts against multiple user records were successfully identified.

